    "prompt": "WRITING TASK 1\nAllow about 20 minutes.\n\nThe chart compares the percentage of shoppers ordering groceries online in 2010, 2015 and 2020.\nSummarise the main features and make relevant comparisons. Write at least 150 words.\nPPB! original practice material · fictional data.",
    "taskType": "task1",
    "text": "The bar chart compares the proportions of shoppers ordering groceries online in North and South in 2010, 2015 and 2020. All figures are expressed as percentages.\n\nOverall, the proportion in North increased overall, whereas South increased overall. South recorded the higher figure at the end of the period. The difference between the regions widened, from 10 percentage points in 2010 to 15 points in 2020.\n\nIn North, the figure stood at 33% in 2010, before rising to 68% five years later. It then declined to 43% in 2020. The first interval saw a change of 35 percentage points, while the corresponding movement during the second half of the decade was 25 points.\n\nSouth followed a different pattern, starting at 43% and reaching 48% in 2015. By 2020, its figure was 58%. Comparing the two regions directly, South had the larger share at the beginning, while South led at the end. The final figures of 43% for North and 58% for South therefore show a gap of 15 percentage points.",
